<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN STATE NOTES RAISE 2.4 BLN BFR ON DAY ONE.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN STATE NOTES RAISE 2.4 BLN BFR ON DAY ONE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The latest combined issue of 5/7 year and 3/5/7 year state notes has raised a total of 2.4 billion Belgian francs on its first subscription day on Tuesday, the Finance Ministry said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
